1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:05,740
MoveBooks is built so you
can inspect every step.

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,920
Open trust and security to
see its four principles.

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,160
People approve.

4
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:13,420
Consequential decisions are
explicit and attributable.

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:15,100
Rules verify.

6
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,800
Failed financial checks block progress.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,460
Workspaces are owned.

8
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:24,340
The service checks who you are before
it shows a migration, and one account

9
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,560
can't open another's.

10
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:30,180
The fourth principle covers AI, and
its badge shows whether the advisor

11
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,180
and reviewer are live in your release.

12
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,480
When they're on, they can only suggest.

13
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:38,860
Their answers are labelled, limited
in number and tied to a snapshot,

14
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,820
and they never approve, post or verify.

15
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:46,260
If AI is unavailable, the product
falls back to its deterministic

16
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,880
evidence and says so.

17
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:52,340
Every decision lands in evidence and
results, such as mapping approved

18
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:56,560
or first invoice approved, with
the result, who made it and when,

19
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,720
and its recorded details underneath.

20
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:01,840
When something is locked,
the screen tells you why.

21
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:05,420
Later stages stay locked
until earlier ones finish.

22
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:09,400
A blocked mapping has no approve
button and shows its recovery.

23
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:12,880
A paused batch waits for your
decision on a proposed fix.

24
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:17,880
This beta uses synthetic and
de-identified data only, and never

25
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,440
connects to an accounting provider.

26
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:23,540
If you're stuck, open Help for
the current stage or choose Get

27
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:26,020
Help with this step for
one clear way forward.
